@startuml Sequence Diagram - Invite Member to Organization

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "InviteMemberView" as InviteMemberView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "EmailService" as EmailService
participant "Backend" as Backend

Admin -> InviteMemberView : 1 Open invite member page
activate InviteMemberView
InviteMemberView -> InviteMemberView : 2 Display invite form

Admin -> InviteMemberView : 3 Enter member email & role
Admin -> InviteMemberView : 4 Click "Send Invite" button

InviteMemberView -> InviteMemberView : 5 Validate email format

alt [Invalid email]
    InviteMemberView -> InviteMemberView : 6 Error notification
    InviteMemberView -> Admin : 7 Display error notification
else [Valid email]
    InviteMemberView -> ClerkAuth : 8 Create invitation token
    activate ClerkAuth
    ClerkAuth -> ClerkAuth : 9 Generate invite link
    ClerkAuth -> EmailService : 10 Send invite email with link
    activate EmailService
    EmailService -> Admin : 11 Confirmation of invite sent
    deactivate EmailService
    ClerkAuth -> Backend : 12 Store pending invitation
    activate Backend
    Backend -> Backend : 13 Update organization pending invites
    Backend -> InviteMemberView : 14 Success notification
    deactivate Backend
    InviteMemberView -> Admin : 15 Display success notification
    deactivate ClerkAuth
end

deactivate InviteMemberView

@enduml
